# The eonet module: the members of a NASA EONET v3 event (GeoJSON form) that have no shared
# key. packs/eonet-event/pack.md states the evidence for the members that are bound.
module        eonet
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "NASA Earth Observatory Natural Event Tracker (EONET) API v3 documentation, https://eonet.gsfc.nasa.gov/docs/v3 (US Government work)"
key   link   string  -  "address of the API endpoint for this event"
